				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "### System Interface\n{{gtClass:TheHub}} is a starting point for *Tactical-Tools* to connect into the rest of the system. It doubles as an *interface* defined between tools and the underlying system that can be adapted to other Smalltalk environments [Pharo](https://pharo.org),  [Squeak](https://squeak.org)  or [Cuis](https://cuis.st) should the code ever be ported elsewhere.\n##Focal Point for Dedicated Projects\r\nThe same mechanism provides an interface for other dedicated projects built upon Pharo or GT. \n\nAt {{gtMethod:TheHub class>>startUp}}  an auction selects the most suitable class to be  {{gtMethod:TheHub class>>current}} . "
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-07-28T17:14:08.832965+01:00"
					}
				},
